@startuml
title Current web/mobile | Mock booking screen | FR-007
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
actor Learner as L
participant "Web BookingPanel / Mobile BookingScreen" as UI
participant "Booking application service" as S
participant "Local MockBookingGateway" as M
L -> UI: Open demo class
UI -> S: Load class
S -> M: Read demo fixture
M --> UI: Class view
L -> UI: Book class
UI -> S: Book request
S -> M: Check mock eligibility and create local Pending booking
alt rejected
 M --> UI: Typed rejection / recoverable error
else accepted
 M --> UI: Pending booking + status hint
end
note over UI,M: No HTTP request, PostgreSQL write, wallet settlement,\npush notification or live Jitsi join is made by this booking flow.
@enduml
